    NSArray *edits=@[@[@"剪切",@"cut:",@"x"],@[@"复制",@"copy:",@"c"],@[@"粘贴",@"paste:",@"v"],@[@"全选",@"selectAll:",@"a"]];for(NSArray *row in edits)[self item:edit title:row[0]action:NSSelectorFromString(row[1])key:row[2]target:nil];[edit addItem:NSMenuItem.separatorItem];[self item:edit title:@"查找与替换"action:@selector(find:)key:@"f"target:self];
